     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "1 line fix to remove validation of the datastream filename in the zip file (as it's not a URL or a file: protocol) has been committed.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Should leave this ticket open though as this is pointing to a lack of tests for ingesting objects using AtomZIP (from memoryi sn't there a parameter that can be supplied to control ingest format for the integration test suite?) ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
