      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>1 line fix to remove validation of the datastream filename in the zip file (as it's not a URL or a file: protocol) has been committed.</p>\n\n<p>Should leave this ticket open though as this is pointing to a lack of tests for ingesting objects using AtomZIP (from memoryi sn't there a parameter that can be supplied to control ingest format for the integration test suite?) </p>",
